er writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 15: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 16: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 17: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 18: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 19: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 20: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 21: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 22: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\"}]}]},\"number\":4,\"named\":true,\"summary\":\"The mirror-first rollout\",\"authors\":[{\"kind\":\"session\",\"id\":\"e2e-reading-pane\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T15:24:38.684667Z\",\"size\":1578,\"sha256\":\"3dbc256416759b3f5ba2a0e04529ca636d2936b083d79115d22450bb306c04df\"}\n"
